<title>USA: Health Outcomes enters consulting pact.</title>
<headline>Health Outcomes enters consulting pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Outcomes Management Inc said on Friday it reached agreement with Option Care Inc to provide a series of training programs and software tools for its home infusion therapy system, FOCIS.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Health Outcomes develops and supplies healthcare software systems.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
